<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Alerting on materialize-monitoring Documentation</title><link>https://materializeinc.github.io/materialize-monitoring/preview/heather-roadmap-q4/alerting/</link><description>Recent content in Alerting on materialize-monitoring Documentation</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="https://materializeinc.github.io/materialize-monitoring/preview/heather-roadmap-q4/alerting/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Configuring</title><link>https://materializeinc.github.io/materialize-monitoring/preview/heather-roadmap-q4/alerting/configuring/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://materializeinc.github.io/materialize-monitoring/preview/heather-roadmap-q4/alerting/configuring/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="configuring-alerting"&gt;Configuring Alerting&lt;a class="anchor" href="#configuring-alerting"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;A default install runs two rule evaluators and one notifier.&#10;Thanos Ruler evaluates PromQL, Loki Ruler evaluates LogQL, and both send what they produce to a single Alertmanager.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The evaluators are wired; the rules and the routing are not built yet.&lt;/strong&gt;&#10;&lt;code&gt;pre-rendered/rules/&lt;/code&gt; ships empty, and the bundled Alertmanager carries no routing tree, so an alert that fires today reaches a null receiver.&#10;What this page describes is the path an alert will travel, and the parts of it an operator configures now.&#10;The remaining work is described in the &lt;a href="../../reference/internal/design-docs/20260917-alerting-self-managed/"&gt;alerting design doc&lt;/a&gt; (internal) and tracked under &lt;a href="https://linear.app/materializeinc/issue/DEP-216" rel="external nofollow" class="internal-protected-link"&gt;DEP-216&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Alert Channels</title><link>https://materializeinc.github.io/materialize-monitoring/preview/heather-roadmap-q4/alerting/channels/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://materializeinc.github.io/materialize-monitoring/preview/heather-roadmap-q4/alerting/channels/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="alert-channels"&gt;Alert Channels&lt;a class="anchor" href="#alert-channels"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;</description></item><item><title>Maintenance Windows</title><link>https://materializeinc.github.io/materialize-monitoring/preview/heather-roadmap-q4/alerting/maintenance/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://materializeinc.github.io/materialize-monitoring/preview/heather-roadmap-q4/alerting/maintenance/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="maintenance-windows"&gt;Maintenance Windows&lt;a class="anchor" href="#maintenance-windows"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>